  {
   "oldText": "description: Solve ARC grids with rectangular frames and enclosed regions, or noisy solid rectangular fields; infer fills and colors from demonstrations.",
   "newText": "description: Solve ARC grids with rectangular frames, enclosed regions, or noisy solid rectangular fields by inferring demonstrated cell-change rules."
  },
  {
   "oldText": "1. Compare input and output cell by cell. Identify solid fields, frame boundaries, enclosed interiors, anomalous pixels, and any repeated or aligned patterns; distinguish a hollow frame from a noisy solid field. Record every changed cell and relevant unchanged controls rather than narrating tentative interpretations.\n2. Infer the exact condition for each change: which structure, color, position, alignment, or relation qualifies, and the replacement value. Check the rule against all demonstrated changes and invariants, including apparent exceptions; do not extrapolate from one changed cell or infer a broad fill/recolor rule from a sparse example. If competing rules remain, request another demo.\n3. Apply only a rule that accounts for every demo change to the test grid. Preserve all cells not selected by the verified condition, then check dimensions and each changed/unchanged cell before submitting. When demos do not establish a rule, request a demo instead of submitting a guess.",
   "newText": "1. Compare inputs and outputs cell by cell. Identify solid fields, frame boundaries, enclosed interiors, anomalous pixels, and repeated/aligned patterns; distinguish hollow frames from noisy solid fields. Record changed cells and informative unchanged controls.\n2. Infer the exact qualifying structure, color, position, alignment, or relation and replacement value. Check all changes and invariants, including exceptions; do not extrapolate a broad fill/recolor rule from a sparse example. When rules remain ambiguous, use `arc-stream-actions` to request a discriminating demo.\n3. Apply only a rule accounting for all demonstrated changes. Preserve unselected cells and check dimensions and changed/unchanged cells. Follow `arc-stream-actions` for full validation and the required action protocol."
  }
 ]
}

